---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import TourCard from '../components/TourCard.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const cleanBase = base.endsWith('/') ? base : `${base}/`;
---

<BaseLayout title="Destino Camagüey | CartaCuba" activePage="destino">
  <div class="grain-texture fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40"></div>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative h-[60vh] min-h-[450px] overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center text-center">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center" style={`background-image: url('${cleanBase}images/cartel_de_camaguey.jpeg');`}>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/50"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4 text-white">
      <span class="inline-block bg-primary/30 border border-primary-fixed/40 text-primary-fixed px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full font-label-md text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">
        Explora la Región Agramontina
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-display-lg text-display-lg-mobile md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight drop-shadow-md">
        Descubre Camagüey
      </h1>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-white/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-sm md:text-base">
        Explora la biodiversidad de sus áreas protegidas, el laberinto colonial más grande del Caribe y sus ricas tradiciones alfareras.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="relative z-10 bg-background min-h-screen">
    <!-- ================= NATURALEZA ================= -->
    <div id="naturaleza">
      <!-- Species Spotlight: Cartacuba -->
      <section class="py-20 bg-surface-container-low relative">
        <div class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
            <div class="relative">
              <div class="leaf-corner overflow-hidden aspect-[4/5] shadow-xl">
                <img class="w-full h-full object-cover" alt="Cartacuba bird (Todus multicolor)" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCQwIULpWJ17ul5O1lHNna3YCyoTqOcSpFNP6hAEr2R3LJZQh0wTv2e2W4dELlbm4L6cwIXQPJ70029GuW8QIgG6u4lSDvDIGN5k1yulQv01LD1Zq7j_yCmbrlTJwNXI44iZ7VJMm_K50md6EjmwJ8fqZUj2C8iSXe6ZCBZch1Ao9EfptJ5TeWuhkf1SvHss0q35zRjb5Sh6omjUBP-JRGL2t3JW91GHlBx4pTA3Kk32k3e_PhvumMRJ9rZH-BeAQcW5HLf8VrJKRXQCg">
              </div>
              <div class="absolute -bottom-8 -right-8 bg-primary-fixed p-8 leaf-corner shadow-lg max-w-[200px]">
                <span class="text-on-primary-fixed font-headline-sm block mb-2 font-semibold">Todus multicolor</span>
                <p class="text-on-primary-fixed/90 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Joya Endémica</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-primary font-label-md uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2">Fauna Emblemática</span>
              <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-6 font-semibold">La Cartacuba</h2>
              <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-6">
                El homónimo y ave símbolo de nuestra marca, la <em>Cartacuba</em> (Todus multicolor), es una diminuta maravilla de la biosfera. Con apenas 11 centímetros, esta criatura iridiscente habita en las reservas naturales de la provincia, especialmente en los bosques y laderas de la Sierra de Najasa, encarnando la vibrante resiliencia de la fauna camagüeyana.
              </p>
              <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary p-2 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg">nest_multi_room</span>
                  <div>
                    <strong class="text-on-surface block font-bold">Hábitat Único y Reservas Naturales</strong>
                    <span class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Anida en madrigueras de tierra excavadas en bancos de arcilla verticales a lo largo de senderos sombreados, protegida dentro del ecosistema de la Sierra de Najasa y otras reservas naturales.</span>
                  </div>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary p-2 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg">palette</span>
                  <div>
                    <strong class="text-on-surface block font-bold">El Rojo "Cartacuba"</strong>
                    <span class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Famosa por su distintiva garganta roja brillante, pecho rosado y su plumaje verde metálico que brilla en el bosque.</span>
                  </div>
                </li>
              </ul>
              <div class="p-6 bg-surface-container-highest rounded-xl border-l-4 border-primary">
                <p class="italic text-on-surface font-headline-sm text-lg">"En el silencio de la Sierra de Najasa y las reservas naturales, el chasquido del pico de la Cartacuba es el auténtico latido del bosque."</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Flora Botánica -->
      <section class="py-20 bg-surface-container-high">
        <div class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto">
          <div class="max-w-xl mb-12">
            <span class="text-primary font-label-md uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2">Botánica Nativa</span>
            <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-4 font-semibold">Flora Botánica</h2>
            <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">La flora endémica camagüeyana es un testimonio de resiliencia en ecosistemas únicos, desde las orquídeas de las áreas montañosas hasta la majestuosa palma real y la palma yarey en las llanuras.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-gutter">
            <!-- Flora Item 1 -->
            <div class="group">
              <div class="aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4 shadow-sm group-hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" alt="Orquídea Silvestre" src={`${cleanBase}images/orquideas.jpeg`}>
              </div>
              <h4 class="font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Orquídea Silvestre</h4>
              <p class="text-label-md text-primary uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Orchidaceae</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Flora Item 2 -->
            <div class="group">
              <div class="aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4 shadow-sm group-hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" alt="Coral Shrub" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCXb3g3-vDuDx-GJe0ZkIOPJ0QQdfGNJLAEwYoTcKfysmwUuKhL-v1fn5QwjsyhIas4Tb5jvCaLKsGrhL5ZeNiZ9bIXjSf2_PwQJ9FctJFfhSHfNH6qLTWIorcHB2rjcu3cMUg0CIpOAhwopcLL8ZD0WhyY4ECSxM4S3XIeKiPqs7tF-fOs95G2VJgOeDY7Avq9dwW2GGoiKEiRlWPBGZiTeH0nWDJXWfjxLJS3V9jRQXuVTo5LrG7xrc71Aoz__kntjy4UHLGiTE0">
              </div>
              <h4 class="font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Palo de Coral</h4>
              <p class="text-label-md text-primary uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Hamelia patens</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Flora Item 3 -->
            <div class="group">
              <div class="aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4 shadow-sm group-hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" alt="Palma Real" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCTYekWgiJg7mjash0-EsDEHFVkz1vF6vcLYV7cyTMJ_TbNCZ0IWBIdike0XnolMCk12c7MGJQq8XhL1EVD0dQSPPdbXmkHi05SYQAXMrl24PU7k-NuITvj36bbwfwwKRE6yTawSliJHwvtuyENpOz6_tWK0CxCaw5jbbApo5nTPEnEEMTO8opD5YWlNynq95nXhasbYxQO8ecGFQHsr_9QAyjmcsYbFlkW0F_AjOg6B_VW8K_T8Yw0gkzlrKP4WwSm8nZdHBhkQjM">
              </div>
              <h4 class="font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Palma Real</h4>
              <p class="text-label-md text-primary uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Roystonea regia</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Flora Item 4 -->
            <div class="group">
              <div class="aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4 shadow-sm group-hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" alt="Helecho Arborescente" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDUw__XYkIP58d9K9uc_OnugN6K_rJGts7KrDmPaxXq-llydk_d9bR-H7JWOKDCsk6gXs9z3qGg-nO_jrunH-mes9g71-13XPkLUwmNHZ_E1_PPrFjy4m5HOyBSkxndbj5v4wVFUS2lyFN26BDhuQzvb1TFZ0VX37doJpIT4_f1dt--WX3fIgSBaejy_FXRDzYNUez8y0XaCJn01QYlo8L-hW72eI7VzzL4P_O4xq47v9ENAqJVh6BuPxPT_azfiNUvXFNZ2hU4l5Y">
              </div>
              <h4 class="font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Helecho Arborescente</h4>
              <p class="text-label-md text-primary uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Cyatheales</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- ================= PATRIMONIO HISTÓRICO ================= -->
    <div id="patrimonio">
      <!-- Mapping & Winding City -->
      <section class="py-20 bg-surface-container-low">
        <div class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-start">
            <!-- Sidebar: Landmarks -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
              <span class="text-primary font-label-md uppercase tracking-wider block">Leyenda de Piedra y Laberintos</span>
              <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface font-semibold">La Ciudad Laberinto</h2>
              <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
                A diferencia de cualquier otra ciudad colonial española, el centro histórico de Camagüey fue trazado como un laberinto defensivo de calles rotas e irregulares y callejones ciegos, concebidos para romper el avance de piratas invasores como Henry Morgan. Hoy en día es Patrimonio de la Humanidad por la UNESCO.
              </p>
              
              <!-- Landmark Card 1 -->
              <div class="group bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-primary transition-all cursor-pointer">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                  <div class="bg-primary-container text-white w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">church</span>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-lg text-on-surface mb-2 font-semibold">San Juan de Dios</h3>
                    <p class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface-variant">La plaza colonial más preservada de Cuba. Un conjunto intacto del siglo XVIII compuesto por iglesia, hospital y casonas.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- Landmark Card 2 -->
              <div class="group bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-primary transition-all cursor-pointer">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                  <div class="bg-primary text-white w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">park</span>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-lg text-on-surface mb-2 font-semibold">Plaza del Carmen</h3>
                    <p class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Plaza empedrada célebre por sus estatuas de bronce a tamaño real, que inmortalizan personajes costumbristas.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- Landmark Card 3 -->
              <div class="group bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-primary transition-all cursor-pointer">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                  <div class="bg-tertiary-container text-white w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">route</span>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-lg text-on-surface mb-2 font-semibold">Callejones de Leyenda</h3>
                    <p class="font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Callejones sumamente estrechos como el callejón de Fundición o el del Silencio, repletos de misterios locales.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Map Interface -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:sticky lg:top-36 mt-8 lg:mt-0">
              <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-surface-container-highest h-[550px]">
                <img alt="Map of Camagüey historic center" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale opacity-30" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCDtK47MuTH0yyDrxrvb3MFUPiQm71qKapo30b6V6oXWOTlreS8lxHcAXWon_Ib955mJ6SuhFTsks0dlDAK2FQ-kM_NaL1grkQV31fEFeza4ivrTns-LslK8_GoLRlXmjl8NKm7dc-XPOKtMvvIz-0huZIHc3HQhXV2k3qPG39XhWV91gXXVuHcR9S9SkqMM9ERGDsP4ezmZb7EsNBFXv2zvi9O2fPqDXxzvhN2lT-udxrlIQv3gCs77sS5n_r-JFVccai0N0Y8hFk">
                <!-- Interactive Hotspots -->
                <div class="absolute inset-0 p-8">
                  <div class="absolute top-1/3 left-1/4 group-hotspot cursor-pointer transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-110">
                    <div class="bg-primary w-6 h-6 rounded-full border-4 border-white shadow-lg animate-pulse"></div>
                    <div class="absolute top-8 -left-10 bg-white dark:bg-inverse-surface p-2 rounded-lg shadow-md font-label-md text-xs whitespace-nowrap text-on-surface border border-outline-variant/30">San Juan de Dios</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/3 group-hotspot cursor-pointer transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-110">
                    <div class="bg-[#bb0017] w-6 h-6 rounded-full border-4 border-white shadow-lg animate-pulse"></div>
                    <div class="absolute top-8 -left-10 bg-white dark:bg-inverse-surface p-2 rounded-lg shadow-md font-label-md text-xs whitespace-nowrap text-on-surface border border-outline-variant/30">Plaza del Carmen</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="absolute top-1/2 right-1/4 group-hotspot cursor-pointer transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-110">
                    <div class="bg-primary-container w-6 h-6 rounded-full border-4 border-white shadow-lg animate-pulse"></div>
                    <div class="absolute top-8 -left-10 bg-white dark:bg-inverse-surface p-2 rounded-lg shadow-md font-label-md text-xs whitespace-nowrap text-on-surface border border-outline-variant/30">La Catedral</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Map Overlay UI -->
                <div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 flex flex-col gap-2">
                  <button class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur p-2 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:bg-white text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">add</span></button>
                  <button class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur p-2 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:bg-white text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">remove</span></button>
                  <button class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur p-2 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:bg-white text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">my_location</span></button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Architectural Bento Grid -->
      <section class="py-20 bg-background">
        <div class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto">
          <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <span class="text-primary font-label-md uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2">Preservación Colonial</span>
            <h2 class="font-display-lg text-display-lg text-on-surface mb-4 font-bold">Detalles Arquitectónicos</h2>
            <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto">Techos altos de viga de madera, rejas de hierro forjado y los infaltables tinajones centenarios definen la fisonomía local.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-gutter">
            <!-- Large Feature Card -->
            <div class="md:col-span-2 relative h-[450px] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer border border-outline-variant/20 shadow-sm">
              <img alt="Colonial Interior patio with tinajones" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" src={`${cleanBase}images/patio_colonial.jpeg`}>
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
              <div class="absolute bottom-0 p-10 text-white">
                <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-2 font-semibold">Patios Coloniales</h3>
                <p class="text-white/80 font-body-md">Verdaderos oasis botánicos e históricos. Diseñados originalmente para recolectar agua en tinajones.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Secondary Feature Card -->
            <div class="bg-surface-container p-10 rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between border border-outline-variant/30">
              <div>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-5xl mb-6">architecture</span>
                <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mb-4 font-semibold">Esfuerzos de Conservación</h3>
                <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">La Oficina del Historiador de Camagüey lidera planes constantes para preservar las molduras coloniales, portales y fachadas encaladas.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-label-md text-sm border-t border-outline-variant/30 pt-6">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">verified</span>
                <span>Patrimonio Cultural Protegido</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Detail Card 1 -->
            <div class="relative h-[300px] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer border border-outline-variant/20 shadow-sm">
              <img alt="Architectural Detail balcon" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBa5jAGWdeBkStoCs7PV-exl9DF_yD5nfdRlQzr5da38uZEMfhc4gqXFQMtedzuM3BHPUMOY4dFtaiNiLnv37rpUQL8BVJ3SBW-wuGC6aNk-QFJi0KUj3N89GeGGfAyFHRuD4dakcNxS8oPM6EVF0RM4W2KUEiyN2Wj2mgLlt3S6W1c4U_BPOHv369ykJdnGHm-RXGCkROsgSTBReednyWNoY6p5ek4FgRv-Ez3VO9eDx7Aj8HF4_0gP8vFL9jaXCZn11_x34k4rbg">
            </div>
            <!-- Detail Card 2 -->
            <div class="relative h-[300px] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer border border-outline-variant/20 shadow-sm">
              <img alt="Winding Street of Camagüey" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" src={`${cleanBase}images/ciudad_desde_el_mirador.jpeg`}>
            </div>
            <!-- Detail Card 3 -->
            <div class="relative h-[300px] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer border border-outline-variant/20 shadow-sm">
              <img alt="UNESCO Plaque on ancient wall" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" src={`${cleanBase}images/ciudad_patrimonial_en_la_tarde.jpeg`}>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- ================= CULTURA Y TRADICIÓN ================= -->
    <div id="cultura">
      <!-- Bento Tradition Grid -->
      <section class="py-20 bg-surface-container-low">
        <div class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">
            <!-- Large Feature: Tinajones -->
            <div class="md:col-span-8 bg-surface-container rounded-3xl overflow-hidden group border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col md:flex-row h-full">
              <div class="md:w-1/2 overflow-hidden h-[300px] md:h-auto">
                <img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700" alt="Clay tinajones in a courtyard" src={`${cleanBase}images/patio_colonial_vista_aerea.jpeg`}>
              </div>
              <div class="md:w-1/2 p-10 flex flex-col justify-center">
                <span class="text-primary font-label-md uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2">Simbolismo Local</span>
                <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-4 text-primary font-semibold">La Leyenda del Tinajón</h3>
                <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6 italic border-l-2 border-primary pl-4">"El que toma agua del tinajón, siempre regresa a Camagüey."</p>
                <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6 text-sm">Estas vasijas de arcilla cocida servían para conservar el agua de lluvia. Hoy son el símbolo regional indiscutible y guardan leyendas de amor y hospitalidad.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Vertical Card: San Juan Camagüeyano -->
            <div class="md:col-span-4 bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container rounded-3xl p-10 relative overflow-hidden group border border-primary-fixed/20 text-white">
              <div class="relative z-10 h-full flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl mb-6 text-primary-fixed">celebration</span>
                  <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm mb-4 font-semibold">San Juan Camagüeyano</h3>
                  <p class="font-body-md text-sm opacity-90 mb-8">El carnaval más antiguo y rítmico de toda Cuba. Congas potentes formadas en los barrios locales recorren la ciudad cada mes de junio en un festejo de pura tradición criolla.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-[12px] opacity-80">Celebrado cada 24-29 de junio</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 opacity-10 group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform duration-1000">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[200px]">festival</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Asymmetric Card: Native Crafts -->
            <div class="md:col-span-6 bg-surface-container-high rounded-3xl p-8 flex gap-8 items-center border border-outline-variant/20">
              <div class="w-1/3">
                <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-square">
